course: dictionary
lesson: 11929
title: Job words in context
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words name a job. When you meet one, look at the words around it to find out what the person does. «The cameraman filmed the football match from the side of the pitch.» You can see he is working with a camera, and the match is being filmed.
explain: A cameraman is a person whose job is to operate a camera for films or television. Operate means to work or control something. So the cameraman is the person behind the camera, making the pictures.
explain: Many words can mean the same thing but feel different. «Our cameraman, Priya, is a camera operator.» Camera operator means the same job and is a more neutral word, because many people who do this job are women.
fact: A cameraman is a person whose job is to operate a camera for films or television.
fact: The plural of cameraman is cameramen: «Two cameramen moved their cameras to get a better view.»
fact: Cameramen film the news, sport and films.
fact: «Camera operator» means the same job, and it is a more neutral word, because many of these workers are women.
fact: When you meet a job word, look at the words around it to find out what the person does.
exercise: «The cameraman filmed the football match from the side of the pitch.» What is a cameraman's job? | To sell tickets at the gate | To kick the ball into the net | To make the pitch wet before the match | *To operate a camera for films or television
exercise: «The two cameramen moved their cameras to get a better view.» What is the plural of cameraman? | camerman | cameras | cameramans | *cameramen
exercise: Mia says her aunt is a cameraman, but her aunt is a woman. Which more neutral word could Mia use? | filmer only | cameraboy | *camera operator | camera stand
test: «The cameraman held the camera steady while the actors walked past.» What does the cameraman do in this sentence? | He drives the bus to the studio | He walks past the actors | *He works a camera to film the actors | He stands still and does nothing
test: Which word means the same job as cameraman but is more neutral? | camera seller | *camera operator | camera mender | camera keeper
exam: «Our cameraman films the weather for the evening news.» What is a cameraman? | *A person whose job is to operate a camera for films or television | A person who fixes cars | A person who reads the news on television | A person who sells cameras in a shop
